    <string name="device_setup_child_title">Lift the child-process limit</string>
    <string name="device_setup_child_ask">Lift Android\'s limit on child processes? Android stops ending desktop programs and Windows games when apps together run more than 32. It applies to every app, and you can undo it here</string>
