    <string name="device_setup_buttons_title">See button presses over games</string>
    <string name="device_setup_buttons_ask">Let droidtop see button presses over other apps? It turns on droidtop\'s accessibility service, which HOME + R2, L2 and Start need over a game, and allows Android\'s restricted settings for droidtop. You can undo it here</string>
