    <string name="device_setup_buttons_by_droidtop">Turned on by droidtop. Press to turn it off again</string>
    <string name="device_setup_power_title">Set game power automatically</string>
    <string name="device_setup_power_ask">Let droidtop set each game\'s power by your rules, the heat and the battery? Recommended. Android\'s per-game power setting changes for the games droidtop starts and goes back when you leave them. You can undo it here</string>
